---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import backpack from '../assets/backpack.png';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Traces of Good People"
  description="About Traces of Good People, a travelling project built around small gifts and chance meetings."
>
  <article class="page">
    <div class="about-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>A record of small, good encounters.</h1>
      </div>

      <figure class="about-illustration">
        <Image
          src={backpack}
          alt="A travel backpack filled with postcards"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Traces of Good People began with a simple thought: travel is shaped less
        by landmarks than by the people we meet along the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        A small gift carries a unique QR code and a number. When someone receives
        it, they can share a short message and, if they wish, a photograph. Over
        time, those moments form a public collection of kind encounters around
        the world.
      </p>
      <p>
        The project asks for very little. It is not a social network and it does
        not track a gift's exact location. It is simply a quiet place to remember
        that good people are everywhere.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a class="text-link" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back home</a>
  </article>
</Layout>
